/*
 * Declares the CompileTimeIntrinsics module.
 *
 * The functions of the runtime have no body the CompileTimeExecutor could run.
 * Those with a pure meaning are given a compile-time implementation here, calling
 * the runtime the compiler is linked against, so that the compile-time result is
 * the one the program gets at run time.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::interpret::intrinsic
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/interpret/intrinsic.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
